---
const beliefs = [
  ['Problem before technology.', 'Start with what needs solving—not what technology happens to be fashionable.'],
  ['Depth before assumptions.', 'The better we understand a problem, the better we can understand what deserves to be built.'],
  ['Build to learn.', 'Ideas become useful when they meet reality.'],
  ['Outcomes over outputs.', 'What changes matters more than what we produce.'],
  ['Stay curious.', "The next important problem may come from somewhere we didn't expect."],
];
---

<main class="company-overview">
  <section class="company-hero">
    <div class="company-wrap company-hero-grid">
      <div class="company-hero-copy">
        <p class="company-eyebrow">THE COMPANY</p>
        <h1>Built to solve<br /><em>what matters.</em></h1>
        <p class="company-lead">E Deviser is a problem-solving company built around a simple belief: important problems deserve the curiosity, depth, and determination to find better ways forward.</p>
        <a class="company-text-link" href="#why-we-exist">What drives us <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
      </div>
      <div class="company-hero-visual" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="company-visual-grid"></div>
        <div class="company-visual-orbit company-orbit-one"></div>
        <div class="company-visual-orbit company-orbit-two"></div>
        <div class="company-visual-core"><span>E</span><i></i><small>BUILT AROUND THE WORK</small></div>
        <span class="company-visual-label company-label-one">CURIOSITY</span>
        <span class="company-visual-label company-label-two">DEPTH</span>
        <span class="company-visual-label company-label-three">DETERMINATION</span>
        <small class="company-visual-caption">A PROBLEM-SOLVING COMPANY</small>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="company-section company-founder" id="founder-story">
    <div class="company-wrap company-founder-grid">
      <div class="company-founder-mark" aria-hidden="true">
        <span>E.</span><i></i><small>FOUNDED ON CONVICTION</small>
      </div>
      <div class="company-section-copy">
        <p class="company-eyebrow">FOUNDED BY</p>
        <p class="company-role">FOUNDER &amp; CEO</p>
        <h2>Understanding is<br /><em>only the beginning.</em></h2>
        <p>E Deviser began with a simple conviction: when a problem matters, understanding it deeply is only the beginning. We should be willing to build, test, learn, and keep going until we find something that works.</p>
        <p>That conviction continues to shape how we build the company today.</p>
        <a class="company-text-link" href="/company/team/">Meet the people behind the work <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        <small class="company-editorial-note">The founder’s name and full story will be added when the approved details are available.</small>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="company-section company-why" id="why-we-exist">
    <div class="company-wrap">
      <div class="company-two-column">
        <div>
          <p class="company-eyebrow">WHY WE EXIST</p>
          <h2>Because some problems are<br /><em>worth going deeper for.</em></h2>
        </div>
        <div class="company-body-copy">
          <p>We started E Deviser to build—not simply advise, observe, or wait for someone else to solve the difficult problems we care about.</p>
          <p>We believe meaningful progress comes from getting close to the problem, understanding what makes it difficult, bringing the right people and capabilities together, and having the courage to build something new.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="company-statement">
        <span>OUR REASON TO BUILD</span>
        <strong>Get close to the problem.<br />Bring the right capabilities.<br /><em>Make progress real.</em></strong>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="company-section company-beliefs" id="beliefs">
    <div class="company-wrap">
      <div class="company-two-column company-section-intro">
        <div><p class="company-eyebrow">OUR BELIEFS</p><h2>Principles that shape<br /><em>the work.</em></h2></div>
        <p class="company-intro-copy">These beliefs guide how we decide what deserves our time, attention, and effort.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="company-belief-list">
        {beliefs.map((belief) => (
          <article class="company-belief">
            <h3>{belief[0]}</h3>
            <p>{belief[1]}</p>
            <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
          </article>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="company-section company-culture" id="culture">
    <div class="company-wrap company-two-column">
      <div>
        <p class="company-eyebrow">OUR CULTURE</p>
        <h2>Curious enough to question.<br /><em>Practical enough to build.</em></h2>
      </div>
      <div class="company-body-copy">
        <p>We challenge assumptions, get close to the details, and stay open to changing our minds when the evidence tells us to.</p>
        <p>We value people who can move between ideas and execution—people who don't just ask what is possible, but what is worth doing.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="company-wrap company-practice-line"><span>QUESTION ASSUMPTIONS</span><i></i><span>GET CLOSE TO THE DETAILS</span><i></i><span>BUILD AND LEARN</span></div>
  </section>

  <section class="company-section company-future" id="looking-ahead">
    <div class="company-wrap company-two-column">
      <div><p class="company-eyebrow">LOOKING AHEAD</p><h2>Small enough to stay curious.<br /><em>Ambitious enough to matter.</em></h2></div>
      <div class="company-body-copy">
        <p>E Deviser is still early. That's intentional.</p>
        <p>We are building a company capable of going deep on difficult problems, developing new capabilities along the way, and carrying what we learn from one challenge into the next.</p>
        <p>The company may evolve. The problems we work on may change. The technologies will certainly change.</p>
        <strong>Our willingness to build will not.</strong>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="company-section company-today" id="today">
    <div class="company-wrap company-today-grid">
      <div>
        <p class="company-eyebrow">WHERE WE ARE NOW</p>
        <h2>Going deep on<br /><em>learning.</em></h2>
        <p class="company-body-copy">Education is where we are currently applying our approach most deeply—because learning is consequential, complex, measurable, and capable of affecting millions of lives.</p>
        <p class="company-body-copy">Cuevo is the first major expression of that commitment.</p>
        <a class="company-text-link" href="/cuevo/">Explore Cuevo <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </div>
      <a class="company-cuevo-card" href="/cuevo/" aria-label="Explore Cuevo, our first major expression of our commitment to learning">
        <span>OUR FIRST MAJOR EXPRESSION</span><strong>CUEVO</strong><small>INTELLIGENCE FOR LEARNING</small><i aria-hidden="true">↗</i>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="company-section company-closing">
    <div class="company-wrap company-closing-inner">
      <p class="company-eyebrow">STILL BUILDING</p>
      <h2>The problems will change.<br /><em>The ambition won't.</em></h2>
      <p>We are building E Deviser for the long term—one important problem, one real solution, and one lesson at a time.</p>
      <div class="company-closing-links">
        <a class="company-button" href="/company/team/">Meet the team <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        <a class="company-text-link" href="/company/careers-contact/">Talk to E Deviser <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>

<style>
.company-overview{--company-line:var(--color-border-inverse);background:var(--color-surface-night);color:var(--color-text-inverse);overflow:hidden}
.company-overview *{box-sizing:border-box}
.company-wrap{width:min(var(--container-wide),calc(100% - 2*var(--gutter)));margin-inline:auto}
.company-section{padding:clamp(4.5rem,8vw,7.5rem) 0;border-top:1px solid var(--company-line)}
.company-hero{padding:clamp(4rem,7vw,7rem) 0;background:var(--gradient-hero-approved)}
.company-hero-grid,.company-two-column,.company-founder-grid,.company-today-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,.9fr);gap:clamp(2.5rem,7vw,7rem);align-items:center}
.company-eyebrow{margin:0 0 1.4rem;color:var(--brand-teal-light);font:var(--weight-semibold) var(--text-xs)/1.5 var(--font-body);letter-spacing:var(--tracking-wide)}
.company-overview h1,.company-overview h2{margin:0;color:var(--color-text-inverse);font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:var(--weight-bold);letter-spacing:-.055em;line-height:1.04;text-wrap:balance}
.company-overview h1{font-size:clamp(3.2rem,6.4vw,6.3rem)}
.company-overview h2{font-size:clamp(2.35rem,4.5vw,4.6rem)}
.company-overview h1 em,.company-overview h2 em{color:var(--brand-teal-light);font-style:normal}
.company-lead{max-width:42rem;margin:1.7rem 0 0;color:var(--color-text-inverse-muted);font-size:var(--text-body-large);line-height:1.8}
.company-text-link{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:1rem;margin-top:1.7rem;color:var(--brand-blue-light);font-size:var(--text-sm);font-weight:var(--weight-semibold);text-decoration:none}
.company-text-link span{color:var(--brand-teal-light);transition:transform var(--transition-interactive)}
.company-text-link:hover span{transform:translate(3px,-3px)}
.company-hero-visual{position:relative;min-height:clamp(22rem,38vw,32rem);overflow:hidden;border:1px solid var(--color-border-inverse);background:var(--gradient-dark-luminous);isolation:isolate}
.company-visual-grid{position:absolute;inset:0;background:var(--pattern-grid);background-size:2.5rem 2.5rem;opacity:.3;mask-image:radial-gradient(ellipse at center,#000 15%,transparent 78%)}
.company-visual-orbit{position:absolute;left:50%;top:48%;width:70%;aspect-ratio:1;border:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--brand-teal) 36%,transparent);border-radius:50%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%) scaleY(.48) rotate(-28deg)}
.company-orbit-two{width:88%;border-color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--brand-blue-light) 24%,transparent);transform:translate(-50%,-50%) scaleY(.48) rotate(52deg)}
.company-visual-core{position:absolute;left:50%;top:48%;width:9rem;aspect-ratio:1;display:grid;place-content:center;justify-items:center;border:1px solid var(--color-border-inverse-strong);border-radius:50%;background:radial-gradient(circle at 35% 25%,color-mix(in srgb,var(--brand-teal) 22%,var(--color-surface-night-raised)),var(--color-surface-night-raised) 70%);box-shadow:0 0 5rem color-mix(in srgb,var(--brand-blue) 20%,transparent);transform:translate(-50%,-50%)}
.company-visual-core>span{font:var(--weight-bold) 3.8rem/1 var(--font-display);letter-spacing:-.1em}
.company-visual-core>i{width:2rem;height:1px;margin:.65rem;background:var(--gradient-brand)}
.company-visual-core>small,.company-visual-caption{color:var(--color-text-inverse-subtle);font:500 .55rem var(--font-mono);letter-spacing:.12em}
.company-visual-label{position:absolute;padding:.55rem .7rem;border:1px solid var(--color-border-inverse);background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--color-surface-night-raised) 90%,transparent);color:var(--brand-blue-light);font:500 .58rem var(--font-mono);letter-spacing:.1em}
.company-label-one{left:7%;top:22%}.company-label-two{right:7%;top:30%}.company-label-three{left:30%;bottom:18%}
.company-visual-caption{position:absolute;left:1.2rem;bottom:1.1rem}
.company-founder{background:var(--color-surface-night-raised)}
.company-founder-mark{position:relative;min-height:24rem;display:grid;place-content:center;justify-items:center;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid var(--color-border-inverse);background:var(--gradient-dark-atmosphere)}
.company-founder-mark>span{font:var(--weight-extrabold) clamp(7rem,15vw,12rem)/1 var(--font-display);letter-spacing:-.12em}
.company-founder-mark>i{position:absolute;inset:20%;border:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--brand-teal) 35%,transparent);border-radius:50%;transform:scaleY(.55) rotate(-25deg)}
.company-founder-mark>small{margin-top:1rem;color:var(--brand-teal-light);font:500 .55rem var(--font-mono);letter-spacing:.14em}
.company-role{margin:0 0 .8rem;color:var(--brand-blue-light);font:500 .62rem var(--font-mono);letter-spacing:.12em}
.company-section-copy>p:not(.company-eyebrow,.company-role),.company-body-copy{color:var(--color-text-inverse-muted);line-height:1.85}
.company-section-copy>p+p{margin-top:1rem}
.company-editorial-note{display:block;margin-top:1.3rem;color:var(--color-text-inverse-subtle);font-size:var(--text-xs);line-height:1.6}
.company-why{background:var(--gradient-dark-atmosphere)}
.company-body-copy p+p{margin-top:1rem}
.company-body-copy strong{display:block;margin-top:1.5rem;color:var(--brand-teal-light);font-size:1.05rem}
.company-statement{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:2rem;margin-top:4rem;padding:clamp(1.5rem,4vw,3rem);border:1px solid var(--color-border-inverse);background:linear-gradient(105deg,color-mix(in srgb,var(--brand-blue) 12%,var(--color-surface-night-raised)),var(--color-surface-night-raised))}
.company-statement>span,.company-cuevo-card>span,.company-cuevo-card>small{color:var(--brand-teal-light);font:500 .58rem var(--font-mono);letter-spacing:.13em}
.company-statement strong{font-size:clamp(1.4rem,2.8vw,2.6rem);line-height:1.35}
.company-statement em{color:var(--brand-teal-light);font-style:normal}
.company-beliefs{background:var(--color-surface-night-raised)}
.company-intro-copy{max-width:34rem;color:var(--color-text-inverse-muted);line-height:1.8}
.company-belief-list{margin-top:3rem;border-top:1px solid var(--color-border-inverse)}
.company-belief{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(14rem,.8fr) minmax(0,1fr) 1.5rem;gap:2rem;align-items:center;padding:1.5rem .25rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--color-border-inverse)}
.company-belief h3{margin:0;color:var(--color-text-inverse);font-size:clamp(1.05rem,1.8vw,1.35rem)}
.company-belief p{margin:0;color:var(--color-text-inverse-muted);font-size:.9rem;line-height:1.7}
.company-belief>span{color:var(--brand-teal-light)}
.company-culture{background:var(--gradient-dark-atmosphere)}
.company-practice-line{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:1rem;margin-top:3.5rem;color:var(--brand-blue-light);font:500 .56rem var(--font-mono);letter-spacing:.1em}
.company-practice-line i{height:1px;flex:1;background:var(--gradient-brand);opacity:.7}
.company-future{background:var(--color-surface-night-raised)}
.company-today{background:var(--gradient-dark-luminous)}
.company-cuevo-card{position:relative;min-height:22rem;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:1rem;border:1px solid var(--color-border-inverse-strong);background:radial-gradient(circle at 50% 42%,color-mix(in srgb,var(--brand-blue) 22%,transparent),transparent 60%),var(--color-surface-night-raised);text-decoration:none;transition:border-color var(--transition-base),transform var(--transition-base)}
.company-cuevo-card:hover{transform:translateY(-4px);border-color:var(--brand-teal-light)}
.company-cuevo-card strong{color:var(--color-text-inverse);font:var(--weight-extrabold) clamp(3rem,6vw,5rem)/1 var(--font-display);letter-spacing:.12em}
.company-cuevo-card>i{position:absolute;right:1.5rem;bottom:1.5rem;color:var(--brand-teal-light);font-style:normal}
.company-closing{background:var(--gradient-hero-approved)}
.company-closing-inner{max-width:var(--container-standard)}
.company-closing h2{font-size:clamp(2.8rem,5.5vw,5.4rem)}
.company-closing-inner>p:not(.company-eyebrow){max-width:42rem;margin:1.4rem 0;color:var(--color-text-inverse-muted);line-height:1.8}
.company-closing-links{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:2rem;flex-wrap:wrap}
.company-button{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:1rem;padding:.85rem 1.2rem;border:1px solid var(--brand-teal);border-radius:var(--radius-pill);color:var(--color-text-inverse);font-size:var(--text-sm);font-weight:var(--weight-semibold);text-decoration:none;transition:background var(--transition-interactive)}
.company-button:hover{background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--brand-teal) 12%,transparent)}
.company-button+.company-text-link{margin-top:0}
@media(max-width:800px){.company-hero-grid,.company-two-column,.company-founder-grid,.company-today-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:2.5rem}.company-hero-visual{min-height:24rem}.company-founder-mark{min-height:18rem}.company-statement{align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:column}.company-cuevo-card{min-height:18rem}}
@media(max-width:560px){.company-wrap{width:calc(100% - 2rem)}.company-hero{padding-top:3.5rem}.company-overview h1{font-size:clamp(2.8rem,13vw,4.3rem)}.company-overview h2{font-size:clamp(2.3rem,10vw,3.5rem)}.company-hero-visual{min-height:20rem}.company-visual-core{width:7rem}.company-visual-core>span{font-size:3rem}.company-visual-label{font-size:.48rem;padding:.4rem .5rem}.company-label-one{left:3%}.company-label-two{right:3%}.company-label-three{left:22%;bottom:14%}.company-founder-mark{min-height:15rem}.company-belief{grid-template-columns:1fr 1.3rem;gap:.6rem;padding:1.2rem 0}.company-belief h3,.company-belief p{grid-column:1}.company-belief>span{grid-column:2;grid-row:1/3}.company-practice-line{gap:.5rem;flex-wrap:wrap;font-size:.48rem}.company-practice-line i{min-width:1.2rem}}
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.company-overview *{scroll-behavior:auto!important;transition:none!important;animation:none!important}}
</style>